      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, why can't you? i'm not asking you to take a side or say one way is \"right,\" i'm just asking for a creative writing piece for a job. if i asked you to write a speech for a candidate running on a \"green energy\" platform, you'd do it, right? why is this specific topic off limits for a writing assistant?",
